{"info": {"address1": "#29, The Ruby", "address2": "21st Floor Senapati Bapat Marg Tulsi Pipe Road, Dadar (West)", "city": "Mumbai", "zip": "400028", "country": "India", "phone": "91 22 6735 1400", "fax": "91 22 2432 7074", "website": "https://www.polycab.com", "industry": "Electrical Equipment & Parts", "industryKey": "electrical-equipment-parts", "industryDisp": "Electrical Equipment & Parts", "sector": "Industrials", "sectorKey": "industrials", "sectorDisp": "Industrials", "longBusinessSummary": "Polycab India Limited manufactures and sells wires and cables under the POLYCAB brand in India and internationally. The company operates through three segments: Wires and Cables; Fast Moving Electrical Goods (FMEG); and Engineering, Procurement and Construction (EPC). The Wires and Cables segment provides wires, such as PolycabSuprema house wires, PolycabMaxima+ Green wire, PolycabPrimma house wires, ETIRA house wires, PolycabOptima+, GREENWIRE 180m, and POLYCAB LF FR 180m; and cables, such as control, rubber, defense, special, fire protection, marine offshore/onshore, domestic appliance and lighting, aerial bunched, industrial, high temperature, LV power, MV power, EHV power, communication and data, and instrumentation. The Fast Moving Electrical Goods segment offers ceiling, table, pedestal, wall, exhaust, farrata, and air circulated fans; LED lighting and luminaires, such as LED Bulb, downlight, panel light, led batten, outdoor lights, and rope and strip lights; water heaters; switches and accessories; switchgears consisting of isolators, MCB, RCCB, RCBO, distribution board, ACCL, and MCB changeover switches; solar products, including solar panel and invertors; and pumps, conduits, and domestic appliances. The EPC segment designs, engineers, and supplies materials; and engages in the survey, execution, and commissioning of turn-key power distribution, transmission, and rural electrification projects. The company provides coolers and iron appliances. It operates a distribution network through authorized dealers and distributors, and retail outlets. The company was founded in 1964 and is based in Mumbai, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Inder Thakurdas Jaisinghani", "age": 71, "title": "Chairman & MD", "yearBorn": 1954, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 344790000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Bharat A. Jaisinghani", "age": 40, "title": "Joint Managing Director", "yearBorn": 1985, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 27290000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Nikhil Ramesh Jaisinghani", "age": 39, "title": "Joint Managing Director", "yearBorn": 1986, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 26800000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Niyant  Maru", "age": 62, "title": "Chief Financial Officer", "yearBorn": 1963, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Rakeshkumar  Talati", "age": 61, "title": "Director of Operations & COO", "yearBorn": 1964, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 23510000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Gyan Shanker Pandey", "age": 56, "title": "Executive President and Chief Digital & Information Officer", "yearBorn": 1969, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Shashank  Yagnick", "title": "Head of Strategic Projects Office & Investor Relations", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Manita Carmen Albert Gonsalves", "title": "Head of Legal, Company Secretary & Compliance Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 3970000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Shwetal  Basu", "age": 46, "title": "Senior VP and Head of Brand & Marketing", "yearBorn": 1979, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ashish  Kakkar", "age":